<b>T E R M I N O L O G Y

<i>Field or Tag-field
A Field is a window containing the values for a single audiofile's tag-field 
(or tag-frame).

<i>Fields-tab
A Fields-tab is a Browser's tab and contains 3 Fields.

<i>tab-label
A tab-label is the label printed on top of a Tab.

<i>window-label
A window-label is the label for windows that are inside a multi-window Tab. It
is printed on top of the window.

<i>A+, S+, C+
Alt+, Shift+, Ctrl+

<i>mouse1, mouse3, MW
Mouse left button, mouse right button, mouse wheel

<i>prev, sel
Previous, selected

<i>Wsp
Workspace